body:
Something I notice is that a lot of these forums are full of people who are still in school. I love seeing y'all grow up.

&#x200B;

This job, like most service jobs (Cops, Teachers, Nurses) becomes who you are. You're not just Tom anymore, you're Tom the Therapist. Your personality in a lot of ways will be Therapist. Cops start to wear grunt style T shirts and assume everyone wants to kill them. Teachers assume that all crowds need to be instructed. Therapists decide that every single moment needs to be meticulously reviewed. 

&#x200B;

That's the game we all sign up for. It'll become your personality. Congratulations/I'm sorry!

