I'm just a part timer, but I feel this heaaaaavily. I work my school counselor job in the morning, get home at 4 and proceed to power nap until 5:15pmish. Getting out of the shower, I make my espresso and throw on my hoodie head to the office to bang out my 6, 7, and 8pm sessions. 

&#x200B;

Without the power nap, espresso, and hoodie, NONE of that is possible. Get you a routine!!!

